  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0513.penelope.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0513.penelope.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0513.penelope.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0513_penelope"><head>ΠΗΝΕΛΟΠΗ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="47" xml:id="kock-0513-penelope-47" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0513_penelope">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0513-penelope-47-l1" xml:lang="grc">
                  <foreign xml:lang="grc">καί σε τῇ νουμηνίᾳ</foreign>
                </l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0513-penelope-47-l2" xml:lang="grc">
                  <foreign xml:lang="grc">ἀγαλματίοις ἀγαλοῦμεν ἀεὶ καὶ δάφνῃ.</foreign>
                </l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Bekker. Anecd. 328, 28 <foreign xml:lang="grc">Θεόπομπος Πηνελόπη κτλ.</foreign> cod. <foreign xml:lang="grc">του νουμηνία et πηνελόπῳ.</foreign> prima luna Athenienses in arcem ascendere precesque facere solebant. Aristoph. Pac. 396 sq. Schoemann. Ant. gr.<hi rend="superscript">2</hi> II 422 n. 3. deum aliquem nescio quis adloquitur.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="48" xml:id="kock-0513-penelope-48" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0513_penelope">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0513-penelope-48-l1" xml:lang="grc">
                  <foreign xml:lang="grc">καὶ τὴν ἱερὰν σφάττουσιν ἡμῶν δέλφακα.</foreign>
                </l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 14, 657a <foreign xml:lang="grc">θηλυκῶς (τὴν δέλφακα) . . . Θεόπομπος Πηνελόπῃ κτλ. σφάττουσιν ἡμῶν</foreign> Iacobs. Addit. Ath. 344] <foreign xml:lang="grc">ἡμῶν σφάττουσιν</foreign> A. procorum <foreign xml:lang="grc">ἀσέβεια</foreign> indicari videtur.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="49" xml:id="kock-0513-penelope-49" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0513_penelope">
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 4, 183e <foreign xml:lang="grc">μνημονεύει δὲ τοῦ τριγάνου τούτου . . . Θεόπομπος ἐν Πηνελόπῃ.</foreign> cf. Pherecr. 42.</note>
